{
  "type": "architect_batch",
  "projectId": "p7",
  "taskId": "p7-t1",
  "itemId": "w8",
  "detail": "在 backend/src/routes/comments.js 实现评论路由，挂到 w1 的 Express 应用上；复用 w1 的 X-User-Id 认证中间件与统一 {data}/{error:{message}} 壳，复用 w2 的 comments 表（taskId 外键级联删除）与 w6 的任务/成员查询工具函数。逐个对接三条端点：POST /api/tasks/{id}/comments（作者强制取当前请求头身份，忽略请求体里的 authorUserId/author 等自称字段；content 必填缺失 400；任务不存在 404；任务所属项目成员才可写，公开项目非成员也 403）、GET /api/tasks/{id}/comments（返回 data 数组，每条含 id/taskId/authorUserId/authorName/content/createdAt，authorName 由 users 表 join 得到；任务不存在 404；isPrivate=true 且请求者非成员 403）、DELETE /api/comments/{id}（先查评论，不存在 404；仅 comment.authorUserId === 当前身份可删，否则一律 403——owner、项目成员、项目 owner 都不例外）。权限判定只读中间件解析出的 req.currentUser，绝不信请求体/查询参数；错误分支统一走错误壳，避免把 SQLite 异常直接漏成 500。",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "ac-52",
      "kind": "CONTRACT",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/tasks/{id}/comments",
      "expectedStatus": 201,
      "expected": "加评论成功，作者强制为当前 X-User-Id，请求体里自称的 authorUserId 被忽略",
      "headers": {
        "X-User-Id": "{aid}"
      },
      "body": {
        "content": "首次评论",
        "authorUserId": 999
      },
      "setup": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/users",
          "body": {
            "name": "评论区甲"
          },
          "expectedStatus": 201,
          "extract": {
            "name": "aid",
            "from": "data.id"
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/projects",
          "headers": {
            "X-User-Id": "{aid}"
          },
          "body": {
            "name": "P1"
          },
          "expectedStatus": 201,
          "extract": {
            "name": "pid",
            "from": "data.id"
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/projects/{pid}/tasks",
          "headers": {
            "X-User-Id": "{aid}"
          },
          "body": {
            "title": "T1"
          },
          "expectedStatus": 201,
          "extract": {
            "name": "tid",
            "from": "data.id"
          }
        }
      ],
      "assertJson": [
        {
          "path": "data.content",
          "equals": "首次评论"
        },
        {
          "path": "data.authorUserId",
          "exists": true
        },
        {
          "path": "data.authorUserId",
          "notEquals": 999
        },
        {
          "path": "data.createdAt",
          "exists": true
        }
      ]
    },
